  "prompt": "You have 64 ordered observations from a 30-second video window. Find up to three important spans total across keep, ordinary, uncertain. KEEP means a visually meaningful key action, reveal or result worth retaining; routine repetitive motion or camera wandering alone is insufficient. ORDINARY requires positive visible evidence of low-value routine content. Silent images cannot prove speech unimportant. Use UNCERTAIN when action, value or completion cannot be established. Omitted spans and gaps between sampled images are NOT negative examples. Do not invent audio, intentions or unseen motion. Refer ONLY to observation IDs 0..63, NOT seconds. A span start and end are inclusive observation IDs; evidence IDs must lie inside it. Give one brief factual description (max96 characters), not an essay. At most three non-overlapping spans overall, at least one. Use all three keys with empty arrays allowed. Output only JSON: {\"keep\":[{\"start\":a,\"end\":b,\"evidence\":[i],\"fact\":\"visible fact\"}],\"ordinary\":[],\"uncertain\":[]}."
